{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-derbyshire-and-derby","content_id":"4047a9f0-bde8-419e-aae1-8add90f90643","description":"This consultation seeks views on the local government reorganisation proposals we have received from councils in Derbyshire and Derby.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9338503","isbn":"","title":"Proposals for local government reorganisation in Derbyshire and Derby","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-derbyshire-and-derby/proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-derbyshire-and-derby"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":713924,"filename":"Derbyshire_and_Derby_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf","id":"9408270","isbn":"","number_of_pages":49,"title":"Derbyshire and Derby: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9155712f1615191a23a0/Derbyshire_and_Derby_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on the proposals submitted by councils for the reorganisation of local government in Derbyshire and Derby.  </p>\n\n<p>​Responses to this consultation will inform our decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Summary and analysis of consultation responses added.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-22T10:49:55Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-05T13:30:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-03-26T23:59:00.000+00:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-